Title	Required, 5–120 characters
Bug description	Required, 20–10,000 characters
Expected behavior	Optional, maximum 5,000 characters
Actual behavior	Optional, maximum 5,000 characters
Stack trace/logs	Optional, maximum 20,000 characters


Primary action: Find relevant code.
On submission:
- Pin the investigation to the repository’s current ready index.
- Persist inputs.
- Queue retrieval.
- Open the investigation workspace.
